      "url": "https://ubro-api.egt-digital.com/api/sportsapi/public/containers/v2/lobby/normalized/{containerId}",
      "verified": true,
      "purpose": "THE ODDS FEED for this bookmaker. A \"lobby container\" is a curated bundle of events with their markets and prices. Verified containers carrying prematch football 1X2 include 4155, 4136, 4146, 4147, 4161, 4162, 4169, 4170, 4204, 4988, 5087, 5161, 5170. Shape: {events:{id:{sportId, homeTeam, awayTeam, startTime, live, markets:[{marketTemplateName, marketTitle, outcomes:[{name, odds}]}]}}}. The match RESULT market is the one whose outcome names are 1 / X / 2 — note that other three-way markets exist and are NOT 1X2 (e.g. \"Golul (3)\" is goals within 3 minutes). Prematch means live === false."
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://ubro-api.egt-digital.com/api/sportsapi/public/sports",
      "verified": true,
      "purpose": "EGT Digital public sports API. Unauthenticated, but gated on client device headers: a bare request returns HTTP 488 {\"Message\":\"Missing user device header!\"}. The minimum that satisfies the gate is x-platform-device: desktop + x-platform-lang: ro + x-platform-tz: 180 — ordinary client locale headers. x-platform-hash is NOT verified server-side (junk and omission both return 200) and x-platform-exp is only a client clock, so this is a device-identification header, not a signature or a challenge. Returns the sport catalogue; football is sportId 1001. The per-brand subpath is UBRO."
